36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:30,060 --> 00:01:32,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><font color="#d0c975"><font size="40"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Haruno Sakura</font></font></font></font>

39
00:01:30,060 --> 00:01:32,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><font size="40"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Yamanaka Ino</font></font></font>

40
00:01:34,490 --> 00:01:35,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this point in time,</font>

41
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:40,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't even plan to fight
over Sasuke-chan with you.</font>

42
00:01:41,780 --> 00:01:42,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

43
00:01:42,990 --> 00:01:45,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know who
you're lipping off to?!</font>

44
00:01:46,710 --> 00:01:49,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't press your luck,
crybaby Sakura!</font>

45
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:53,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like...
it seems like Sakura-chan was out of line!</font>

46
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:57,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino's eyes show incredible anger.
She's scary.</font>

47
00:01:57,550 --> 00:01:58,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm.</font>

48
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:00,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— That's not it...
— Huh?</font>

49
00:02:01,890 --> 00:02:04,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura's not the kind of kid
to do things</font>

50
00:02:04,430 --> 00:02:07,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">like needlessly flaunt her
own power and hurt people.</font>

51
00:02:08,310 --> 00:02:12,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She doesn't like having Ino
taking pity on her and pulling punches.</font>

52
00:02:31,460 --> 00:02:32,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— This time for sure,
— This time for sure,</font>

53
00:02:34,130 --> 00:02:35,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— with full strength,
— with full strength,</font>

54
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:41,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— a fair... fight!
— a fair... fight!</font>

55
00:02:42,260 --> 00:02:48,270
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Best Battle</font>

56
00:02:42,260 --> 00:02:48,270
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">is All Right</font>

57
00:02:42,260 --> 00:02:48,270
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Shannaro!!</font>

58
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a Clone Jutsu...?!</font>

59
00:03:06,490 --> 00:03:09,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't a Ninja Academy's
graduation exam!</font>

60
00:03:09,540 --> 00:03:11,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You think you can beat me...</font>

61
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:13,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with a textbook ninja art?!</font>

62
00:03:14,750 --> 00:03:17,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I look carefully, I can find out,
which is the real one right away...</font>

63
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:20,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chakra to my feet at a burst... Then...</font>

64
00:03:20,550 --> 00:03:21,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">repel off the ground!</font>

65
00:03:21,930 --> 00:03:22,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fast!</font>

66
00:03:29,430 --> 00:03:31,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you think I'm the crybaby Sakura
I was until recently,</font>

67
00:03:31,850 --> 00:03:33,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you'll get your fingers burned!</font>

68
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:36,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come like you mean it, Ino!</font>

69
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:41,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I appreciate you saying that...</font>

70
00:03:42,990 --> 00:03:45,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go like I mean it, as you wish!</font>

71
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Way to go, Sakura-chan!</font>

72
00:03:55,130 --> 00:03:56,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Great!</font>

73
00:03:56,090 --> 00:03:57,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really great!</font>

74
00:03:57,920 --> 00:03:59,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With the fundamental movements
using Chakra,</font>

75
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:01,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">she's topnotch among the rookies...</font>

76
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

77
00:04:02,550 --> 00:04:04,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura is at her best.</font>

78
00:04:05,260 --> 00:04:08,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means...
Is she better than me?</font>

79
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:10,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Well!
— That's right.</font>

80
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:12,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Awww!</font>

81
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:15,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sending Chakra all throughout
the body and</font>

82
00:04:16,020 --> 00:04:18,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">using the technique
with it at a right timing...</font>

83
00:04:19,190 --> 00:04:21,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those techniques alone
are better than Sasuke.</font>

84
00:04:22,950 --> 00:04:25,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, from the start,
she was extremely good at...</font>

85
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:28,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">controlling her Chakra, so...</font>

86
00:04:30,750 --> 00:04:32,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Magnificent movements, Sakura-san!</font>

87
00:04:43,970 --> 00:04:46,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, her opponent is good too.</font>

88
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:49,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This evenly-matched battle
looks to take awhile!</font>

89
00:04:58,310 --> 00:05:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since when did this girl
get this strong?!</font>

90
00:05:02,650 --> 00:05:05,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can make it, too...!</font>

91
00:05:06,860 --> 00:05:07,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little...!</font>

92
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:16,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoa!</font>

93
00:05:18,500 --> 00:05:20,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate, it'll never end.</font>

94
00:05:23,090 --> 00:05:24,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is long...</font>

95
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:27,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They've been going at it
for ten minutes, at the least.</font>

96
00:05:37,900 --> 00:05:41,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You shouldn't be evenly
matched with me!</font>

97
00:05:43,030 --> 00:05:46,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What makes you think
I'm evenly matched with you...</font>

98
00:05:47,150 --> 00:05:49,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who's only concerned with looks
and growing your hair frivolously?!</font>

99
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:54,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

100
00:05:55,330 --> 00:05:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You carry your mocking
of me too far!</font>

101
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:58,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot.</font>

102
00:05:58,960 --> 00:06:00,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's going for the bait.</font>

103
00:06:01,460 --> 00:06:04,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows what Ino will do!</font>

104
00:06:04,760 --> 00:06:07,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't like Ino when she's that way...!</font>

105
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're simple-minded...</font>

106
00:06:28,530 --> 00:06:29,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh-oh.</font>

107
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's totally lost it!</font>

108
00:06:36,330 --> 00:06:37,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't need this!</font>

109
00:06:44,050 --> 00:06:46,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Scary...</font>

110
00:06:47,010 --> 00:06:48,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll put an end to this right now!</font>

111
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:53,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make you say that you lost!</font>

112
00:06:53,430 --> 00:06:56,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, don't tell me...</font>

113
00:06:56,430 --> 00:06:57,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be...?</font>

114
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:03,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I recall, that Sign is...</font>

115
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew it...</font>

116
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:07,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's planning to do
the Mind Transfer Jutsu!</font>

117
00:07:07,900 --> 00:07:10,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man... That idiot!</font>

118
00:07:12,370 --> 00:07:16,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand your feelings of frustration,
but that's futile.</font>

119
00:07:16,870 --> 00:07:17,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph!</font>

120
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder!</font>

121
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:22,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art, Mind Transfer Jutsu...</font>

122
00:07:23,130 --> 00:07:26,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Jutsu where the user can take
over the opponent's spirit</font>

123
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:29,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and wrest their body away
for a few minutes...</font>

124
00:07:29,260 --> 00:07:31,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by discharging all of
their own spiritual energy</font>

125
00:07:31,970 --> 00:07:34,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and striking the enemy with it.</font>

126
00:07:35,140 --> 00:07:39,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, there are major flaws
to this formidable Jutsu.</font>

127
00:07:40,810 --> 00:07:47,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, the discharged spiritual energy
can only fly straight and at a slow speed.</font>

128
00:07:50,030 --> 00:07:56,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Second, even in the case of failing
to hit the enemy and missing,</font>

129
00:07:56,620 --> 00:07:59,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the user can't return to her
own body for several minutes.</font>

130
00:08:00,200 --> 00:08:03,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should add that during
that interval, the user's,</font>

131
00:08:03,250 --> 00:08:08,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in other words, your main body
will turn into a doll that won't move at all!</font>

132
00:08:09,340 --> 00:08:10,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the first place,</font>

133
00:08:10,090 --> 00:08:13,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Mind Transfer Jutsu is used
for spying and is not a Jutsu for battle.</font>

134
00:08:14,970 --> 00:08:20,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino, using that Jutsu here
would be equal to suicide...</font>

135
00:08:21,230 --> 00:08:23,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It shouldn't be particularly
scary if she moves about...</font>

136
00:08:24,230 --> 00:08:26,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And not only that,
if she dodges the Jutsu,</font>

137
00:08:26,770 --> 00:08:29,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">she can beat the heck out
of the non-moving opponent.</font>

138
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:34,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that happens, Hayate will be forced
to put an end to the match...</font>

139
00:08:35,160 --> 00:08:36,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what?!</font>

140
00:08:36,950 --> 00:08:38,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't know unless I try!</font>

141
00:08:40,450 --> 00:08:41,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you miss, it's over.</font>

142
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:44,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know that, right?</font>

143
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:49,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the first place,
it's a combination Jutsu to be used</font>

144
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:52,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">after stopping the opponent's
movements during a battle</font>

145
00:08:52,130 --> 00:08:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with my Shadow Possession Jutsu.</font>

146
00:08:53,590 --> 00:08:55,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way!</font>

147
00:08:55,930 --> 00:08:57,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no way, it will hit...</font>

148
00:09:04,270 --> 00:09:05,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot! Stop!</font>

149
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:08,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art, Mind Transfer Jutsu!</font>

150
00:09:22,540 --> 00:09:23,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which one...?</font>

151
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:33,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was unfortunate...</font>

152
00:09:36,550 --> 00:09:37,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino.</font>

153
00:09:38,260 --> 00:09:39,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Has the fat lady sung...?</font>

154
00:09:40,180 --> 00:09:41,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She went and did it...</font>

155
00:09:43,850 --> 00:09:45,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, it's over, eh.</font>

156
00:09:51,070 --> 00:09:51,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...?!</font>

157
00:09:54,900 --> 00:09:57,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You fell for it, Sakura!</font>

158
00:09:59,740 --> 00:10:01,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally caught you!</font>

159
00:10:03,330 --> 00:10:04,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be!</font>

160
00:10:06,620 --> 00:10:07,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, it can.</font>

161
00:10:08,870 --> 00:10:12,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My Sign weaving earlier was just an act,</font>

162
00:10:12,880 --> 00:10:16,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to drive you who was running
about into this contrivance.</font>

163
00:10:17,470 --> 00:10:18,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So?</font>

164
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't move at all, can you?</font>

165
00:10:21,470 --> 00:10:25,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's special rope that's my hair
with Chakra poured in!</font>

166
00:10:28,140 --> 00:10:32,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this, it will be over when
I enter your body and say "give up!"</font>

167
00:10:34,820 --> 00:10:37,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It wouldn't miss
a hundred percent of the time!</font>

168
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:39,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

169
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:44,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That idiot... Her losing it
was also an act?</font>

170
00:10:44,620 --> 00:10:46,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get out of there, Sakura-chan!</font>

171
00:10:47,830 --> 00:10:48,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't move...!</font>

172
00:10:49,830 --> 00:10:50,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...</font>

173
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mind Transfer Jutsu!</font>

174
00:11:17,230 --> 00:11:18,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was unfortunate...</font>

175
00:11:20,450 --> 00:11:21,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She missed!</font>

176
00:11:23,410 --> 00:11:24,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

177
00:11:24,830 --> 00:11:25,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-san...</font>

178
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:27,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

179
00:11:29,870 --> 00:11:30,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

180
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:53,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's with Ino?</font>

181
00:11:53,730 --> 00:11:58,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also... Sakura-chan's acting kind of strange!</font>

182
00:11:58,980 --> 00:12:00,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... surely this is her chance!</font>

183
00:12:00,740 --> 00:12:03,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do it, Sakura-chan!</font>

184
00:12:04,410 --> 00:12:05,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no use.</font>

185
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:08,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think, the Mind Transfer Jutsu there...</font>

186
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:10,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura's had it.</font>

187
00:12:11,910 --> 00:12:12,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mind Transfer...?!</font>

188
00:12:13,790 --> 00:12:16,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means Sakura-san right now is...</font>

189
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:18,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

190
00:12:19,710 --> 00:12:22,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura's spirit has been
completely taken over by Ino.</font>

191
00:12:23,550 --> 00:12:24,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

192
00:12:25,800 --> 00:12:28,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino is inside of Sakura's body now!</font>

193
00:12:29,100 --> 00:12:29,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well.</font>

194
00:12:30,140 --> 00:12:32,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino's purpose is most likely...</font>

195
00:12:34,940 --> 00:12:36,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this, it's over.</font>

196
00:12:37,650 --> 00:12:39,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good bye, Sakura...</font>

197
00:12:51,950 --> 00:12:55,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... Haruno Sakura concede...</font>

198
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:58,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— this match...
— No!</font>

199
00:12:59,380 --> 00:13:00,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

200
00:13:02,010 --> 00:13:02,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsk!</font>

201
00:13:03,170 --> 00:13:05,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's annoying!</font>

202
00:13:05,590 --> 00:13:07,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did your hardest to get here!</font>

203
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:11,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll disgrace women if you lose
to that Sasuke-obsessed girl!</font>

204
00:13:12,810 --> 00:13:15,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I said, those words
are useless...</font>

205
00:13:19,400 --> 00:13:20,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's...</font>

206
00:13:25,820 --> 00:13:26,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this bad chill...?!</font>

207
00:13:31,740 --> 00:13:33,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto is annoying!</font>

208
00:13:38,380 --> 00:13:42,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, that's right...
not to Ino I won't...</font>

209
00:13:43,130 --> 00:13:44,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura?!</font>

210
00:13:45,170 --> 00:13:46,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This can't be happening...</font>

211
00:13:49,970 --> 00:13:51,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

212
00:13:52,470 --> 00:13:53,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you conceding?</font>

213
00:13:56,980 --> 00:13:58,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't be conceding!</font>

214
00:13:58,850 --> 00:14:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

215
00:14:01,650 --> 00:14:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro!</font>

216
00:14:05,530 --> 00:14:06,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which is it?</font>

217
00:14:07,650 --> 00:14:09,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's going on?!</font>

218
00:14:10,530 --> 00:14:11,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...?!</font>

219
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:13,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

220
00:14:17,040 --> 00:14:19,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I messed up my Jutsu...?</font>

221
00:14:19,540 --> 00:14:25,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino... You'll have a terrible time of it
if you don't get out of me quick!</font>

222
00:14:29,010 --> 00:14:31,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong, with Ino?</font>

223
00:14:35,970 --> 00:14:40,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... I won't hold on at this rate...</font>

224
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:42,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Release!</font>

225
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:05,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be...
She shattered Ino's Jutsu!</font>

226
00:15:06,800 --> 00:15:09,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She used too much energy
before the Jutsu...</font>

227
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So she didn't have enough Chakra...?!</font>

228
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:22,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think she has two spirits...
What are you?!</font>

229
00:15:26,110 --> 00:15:28,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Strength that ranks with beauty.</font>

230
00:15:29,450 --> 00:15:32,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Girls can't survive if they're not tough!</font>

231
00:15:33,820 --> 00:15:35,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If caught in that spell,</font>

232
00:15:36,030 --> 00:15:38,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's not that easy to cast out
the invader...</font>

233
00:15:40,330 --> 00:15:41,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino's lack of Chakra...</font>

234
00:15:42,580 --> 00:15:43,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's also that...</font>

235
00:15:44,380 --> 00:15:46,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what was more effective
than that...</font>

236
00:15:46,750 --> 00:15:51,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was the combative spirit towards
Ino she has inside her heart.</font>

237
00:15:51,800 --> 00:15:57,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that was awakened with Naruto's voice
as the trigger and she cast Ino out...?</font>

238
00:15:58,970 --> 00:16:00,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nothing to it.</font>

239
00:16:00,770 --> 00:16:02,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like Naruto...</font>

240
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura's fighting spirit was
much stronger than others.</font>

241
00:16:07,020 --> 00:16:07,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— This is...!
— This is...!</font>

242
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:14,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, both of them should
have hardly any Chakra left.</font>

243
00:16:18,450 --> 00:16:19,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— This is...
— This is...</font>

244
00:16:19,750 --> 00:16:20,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— the end!
— the end!</font>

245
00:17:30,270 --> 00:17:32,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Both parties are unable
to continue the match!</font>

246
00:17:33,610 --> 00:17:35,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By double knockout,</font>

247
00:17:35,490 --> 00:17:38,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no one gets through the
fourth battle of the preliminary!</font>

248
00:17:39,740 --> 00:17:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— Huh?!</font>

249
00:17:44,370 --> 00:17:45,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then...</font>

250
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good grief.</font>

251
00:17:49,210 --> 00:17:50,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Ino!</font>

252
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:51,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-san!</font>

253
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:53,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

254
00:17:53,260 --> 00:17:55,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-A-Are you okay?!</font>

255
00:18:07,480 --> 00:18:09,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Treatment's not necessary.</font>

256
00:18:10,650 --> 00:18:13,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They'll probably wake up after awhile.</font>

257
00:18:17,820 --> 00:18:20,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, that was surprising...</font>

258
00:18:21,580 --> 00:18:22,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

259
00:18:23,950 --> 00:18:25,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto and Sasuke aside...</font>

260
00:18:26,460 --> 00:18:30,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to think even that Sakura who didn't
have what it took has grown this much...</font>

261
00:18:32,750 --> 00:18:34,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A lot happened,</font>

262
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:37,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I really feel like it
was a good thing...</font>

263
00:18:39,130 --> 00:18:40,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">sending her to this Chunin Exam.</font>

