380
00:18:56,190 --> 00:18:59,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seeing that made me all fired up, too!</font>

381
00:19:01,200 --> 00:19:01,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now...</font>

382
00:19:02,780 --> 00:19:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The second one from the
Land of Sand, huh...</font>

383
00:19:04,830 --> 00:19:07,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— This looks to be an interesting match.
— Do your best, Tenten!</font>

384
00:19:16,170 --> 00:19:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like you finally
woke up, eh... Sakura.</font>

385
00:19:21,340 --> 00:19:22,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

386
00:19:22,050 --> 00:19:25,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten, power of youth!</font>

387
00:19:25,390 --> 00:19:26,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go Go!</font>

388
00:19:26,390 --> 00:19:28,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no limit to your youth!</font>

389
00:19:29,520 --> 00:19:32,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our match is already over.</font>

